  <hike>
    <date>2026-10-17</date>
    <place>Cabane Brunet / Col de Lâne, Switzerland</place>
    <!-- <pictures url="/"/> -->
    <comments>Solo hike during my October stay at the chalet in Fionnay. I turned back 50-100 m below the pass: too much snow, too dangerous.</comments>
  </hike>
  <hike>
    <date>2026-10-15</date>
    <place>Mauvoisin / Col de Crête Sèche / Glacier d'Otemma / Cabane de Chanrion, Switzerland</place>
    <!-- <pictures url="/"/> -->
    <comments>E-bike from Mauvoisin to the Otemma water intake. Out and back up the Crête Sèche valley to the Col de Crête Sèche, then out and back up the Otemma valley to the glacier. I didn't meet anyone, but I saw five chamois and two ibex. Short detour via the Cabane de Chanrion.</comments>
  </hike>
